						<p class="ecl-u-type-paragraph-s">For each substance annual gridmaps (1970-2025) are provided. Emission gridmaps are expressed in ton substance / 0.1degree x 0.1degree / year for the .txt and .nc files. Emission fluxes are expressed in kg substance /m2 /s for the .nc files.</p>
