							<span class="ecl-accordion__toggle-flex">
								<span class="ecl-accordion__toggle-title">Click to expand</span>
								<span class="ecl-accordion__toggle-indicator"><svg class="ecl-icon ecl-icon--s ecl-accordion__toggle-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-ecl-accordion-icon=""><use xlink:href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/images/icons/sprites/icons.svg#plus"></use></svg><svg class="ecl-icon ecl-icon--s ecl-accordion__toggle-icon" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" data-ecl-accordion-icon=""><use xlink:href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/images/icons/sprites/icons.svg#minus"></use></svg></span>
							</span>
						</button>
					</h3>
					<div class="ecl-accordion__content" id="accordion-P3-content" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-P3-title" hidden="">
						<p class="ecl-u-type-paragraph-s">For each sector annual gridmaps (1970-2025) are provided for CH4, N2O and CO2. Sector specific gridmaps for fluorinated gases can be downloaded in section 'Annual gridmaps 1970-2025'. Emission gridmaps are expressed in ton substance / 0.1degree x 0.1degree / year for the .txt and .nc files. Emission fluxes are expressed in kg substance /m2 /s for the .nc files. The IPCC 1996 and 2006 codes are used for specification of the sectors.</p>
						<ul class="ecl-unordered-list">
						<li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><strong>1A1a</strong><br />IPCC 1996:1A1a<br />Power industry<ul class="ecl-unordered-list"><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=CO2&sector=ENE" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="CO2">IEA-EDGAR CO2</a></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=CH4&sector=ENE" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="CH4">EDGAR CH4</a></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=N2O&sector=ENE" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="N2O">EDGAR N2O</a></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=GWP_100_AR5_GHG&sector=ENE" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="GWP_100_AR5_GHG">EDGAR GWP_100_AR5_GHG</a></li></ul></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><strong>1A1b+1A1ci+1A1cii+1A5biii+1B1b+1B2aiii6+1B2biii3+1B1c</strong><br />IPCC 1996:1A1b+1A1c+1A5b1+1B1b+1B2a5+1B2a6+1B2b5+2C1b<br />Oil refineries & Transformation industry<ul class="ecl-unordered-list"><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=CO2&sector=REF_TRF" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="CO2">IEA-EDGAR CO2</a></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=CH4&sector=REF_TRF" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="CH4">EDGAR CH4</a></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=N2O&sector=REF_TRF" class="ecl-link ecl-link--default" aria-label="N2O">EDGAR N2O</a></li><li class="ecl-unordered-list__item"><a href="https://edgar.jrc.ec.europa.eu/gallery?release=v2026ghg&substance=GWP_100_AR5_GHG&sector=REF_TRF" class="ecl-link ecl-link--